They should make it
into a chain.

790
00:37:18,037 --> 00:37:21,607
Well, I'm a secret agent,
you now.

791
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,942
Nice little place you have.

792
00:37:22,975 --> 00:37:24,877
One of the best
in barcelona.

793
00:37:24,910 --> 00:37:27,547
And the most expensive.

794
00:37:27,580 --> 00:37:29,648
You are drunk, senor al,
you ought to go home.

795
00:37:29,682 --> 00:37:30,983
