800
00:37:52,805 --> 00:37:55,073
Explain to me why they're
called buffalo wings!

801
00:37:55,107 --> 00:37:56,508
By the way,
it's my birthday.

802
00:37:56,542 --> 00:37:58,510
Don't I get
a little cupcake?

803
00:38:01,180 --> 00:38:02,382
It's jerry reed!

804
00:38:02,415 --> 00:38:04,150
- Hit him!
- Yeah.

805
00:38:07,085 --> 00:38:08,720
This man could--

806
00:38:08,753 --> 00:38:11,257
oh, I saw ed ames
do that on carson.

807
00:38:15,460 --> 00:38:17,697
Hey, jive and potter
performed here.

808
00:38:19,598 --> 00:38:21,800
Something is not clicking
with this business.

809
00:38:21,833 --> 00:38:23,768
Management problems
or something.

810
00:38:25,872 --> 00:38:28,072
Mr. Lincoln? Thank you.

811
00:38:31,143 --> 00:38:33,012
Abe lincoln's a bad cop
on the loose.

812
00:38:37,382 --> 00:38:39,285
Ah, the annual running
of the secret agents

813
00:38:39,318 --> 00:38:41,253
