coming back down.

839
00:39:55,962 --> 00:39:58,563
[Servo scats]

840
00:39:58,597 --> 00:40:01,333
Senator mike mansfield
in hot pursuit.

841
00:40:04,503 --> 00:40:08,340
It's kind of
escher-esque, isn't it?

842
00:40:08,373 --> 00:40:09,975
I had no patience
for the elevator,

843
00:40:10,008 --> 00:40:11,343
