854
00:40:35,367 --> 00:40:37,570
Why, hello, mike.

855
00:40:37,603 --> 00:40:39,003
Hi, tom.

856
00:40:39,037 --> 00:40:40,605
I bet you're really surprised

857
00:40:40,638 --> 00:40:43,108
