858
00:40:43,142 --> 00:40:44,543
Not particularly.

859
00:40:44,577 --> 00:40:47,412
Aren't you going to ask me
why I'm here?

860
00:40:47,445 --> 00:40:48,447
No.

861
00:40:48,480 --> 00:40:50,015
Come on, mike, ask me.

862
00:40:50,048 --> 00:40:51,350
Okay.
Why are you here?

863
00:40:51,383 --> 00:40:55,120
I'm here, mike nelson,
because this is your life.

864
00:40:55,153 --> 00:40:57,322
Oh, wow. That's great.

865
00:40:57,355 --> 00:40:59,325
Dry those tears of joy,
