870
00:41:07,398 --> 00:41:08,900
[Crow]
Hi, mike. How ya doin'?

871
00:41:08,933 --> 00:41:10,435
Do you recognize
that voice, mike?

872
00:41:10,468 --> 00:41:12,370
Yeah, it's crow.
I mean, you know...

873
00:41:12,403 --> 00:41:13,805
Well, that's amazing.

874
00:41:13,838 --> 00:41:16,442
You still recognize the voice
of your dear, old friend.

875
00:41:16,475 --> 00:41:17,843
I just saw him.

876
00:41:17,877 --> 00:41:19,212
But wait, mike.

877
00:41:19,245 --> 00:41:20,545
There's lots more surprises

878
00:41:20,578 --> 00:41:22,180
