879
00:41:22,213 --> 00:41:25,050
Do you by any chance
remember this guy?

880
00:41:25,083 --> 00:41:26,618
[Crow]
Hi, mike. How ya doin'?

881
00:41:26,652 --> 00:41:28,587
I was doing fine, yeah.

882
00:41:28,620 --> 00:41:30,688
And those beloved memories
just keep flooding back.

883
00:41:30,722 --> 00:41:32,658
Now who could forget
this beloved pal

884
00:41:32,692 --> 00:41:35,327
