bygone days of yore?

885
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:36,662
[Crow]
Hi, mike. How ya doin'?

886
00:41:36,695 --> 00:41:38,097
Uh, tom?

887
00:41:38,130 --> 00:41:40,798
This must be a very emotional
evening for you, mike, eh?

888
00:41:40,832 --> 00:41:43,568
Tom, did you even try
to contact anybody else?

889
00:41:43,602 --> 00:41:45,070
