My old girlfriend
from high school.

891
00:41:47,138 --> 00:41:48,340
[Crow]
Hi, mike. How ya doin'?

892
00:41:48,373 --> 00:41:50,208
My teachers, my parents?

893
00:41:50,242 --> 00:41:51,843
Hey, those are really
good ideas, mike.

894
00:41:51,877 --> 00:41:55,680
But wait.
Here comes your old,
dear pal crow "t" robot.

895
00:41:55,713 --> 00:41:57,315
Hi, mike! How ya doin'!

896
00:41:57,348 --> 00:41:58,350
[Laughter]

897
00:41:58,383 --> 00:41:59,452
You know, and ralph edwards

898
00:41:59,485 --> 00:42:01,220
