these charm bracelets

899
00:42:01,253 --> 00:42:03,155
to commemorate the evening?

900
00:42:03,188 --> 00:42:04,357
Ralph edwards.

901
00:42:04,390 --> 00:42:05,557
You know,
that's a really good idea.

902
00:42:05,590 --> 00:42:07,125
You should buy
one of them there, mike.

903
00:42:07,158 --> 00:42:11,330
Because, mike nelson,
this was your life!

904
00:42:11,363 --> 00:42:12,865
Next week, angie dickinson,

905
00:42:12,898 --> 00:42:15,767
but until then,
I'm tom servo...

906
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:17,603
And crow "t" robot saying...

907
00:42:17,637 --> 00:42:18,770
[Alarm beeping]

908
00:42:18,803 --> 00:42:21,040
