This is your--
movie time!

909
00:42:37,990 --> 00:42:38,990
Ha ha, mike.

910
00:42:39,023 --> 00:42:40,993
That was sweet.
Thank you.

911
00:42:41,027 --> 00:42:43,162
Jeez. Can't he ever
use the door?

912
00:42:43,195 --> 00:42:46,832
Don't tell me you've never
been in an artist's studio.

913
00:42:46,865 --> 00:42:49,067
Uh-uh. Not this way.

914
00:42:49,100 --> 00:42:51,637
Uh, are you looking
for someone?

915
00:42:51,670 --> 00:42:54,238
Oh, no. I just like
running around the roofs.

916
00:42:54,272 --> 00:42:55,607
It kind of relaxes me.

917
00:42:55,640 --> 00:42:56,908
Do you mind if I drop in?

918
00:42:56,942 --> 00:42:58,343
Please do.

919
00:42:58,377 --> 00:43:00,345
I was hoping you wouldn't
use that joke, by the way.

920
00:43:00,378 --> 00:43:01,747
[Suavely]
Ow, my ankle.

921
00:43:01,780 --> 00:43:04,850
Thank you.

922
00:43:04,883 --> 00:43:06,018
What do you think of it?

923
00:43:06,052 --> 00:43:07,118
I'd like to sleep
with that painting.

924
00:43:07,152 --> 00:43:08,520
[Knock at door]
What do I say?

925
00:43:08,553 --> 00:43:10,255
Whoever's knocking
at your door

926
00:43:10,288 --> 00:43:11,757
