to speak with me.

927
00:43:11,790 --> 00:43:13,525
But I don't want to see 'em.

928
00:43:13,558 --> 00:43:14,660
Is there any place I can hide?

929
00:43:14,693 --> 00:43:16,195
In your cleavage, perhaps?

930
00:43:16,228 --> 00:43:19,130
[Man]
Open up. Open up!

931
00:43:19,163 --> 00:43:20,298
"Lattice" in.

932
00:43:20,332 --> 00:43:23,668
[Laughter]
That's a good one.

933
00:43:23,702 --> 00:43:27,940
What in heaven's name
is going on?

934
00:43:27,973 --> 00:43:30,942
HEY, SHE PAINTS AS GOOD
AS LINDA McCARTNEY?

935
00:43:30,975 --> 00:43:33,045
Well, why are you
standing out there?

936
00:43:33,078 --> 00:43:35,913
- Boing.
- Come on in.

937
00:43:35,947 --> 00:43:38,483
Heh. You see, we're here
