938
00:43:38,517 --> 00:43:40,785
Yes, yes.

939
00:43:40,818 --> 00:43:42,287
We're looking for a man.

940
00:43:42,320 --> 00:43:44,255
Are you him?

941
00:43:44,288 --> 00:43:46,425
My word.
So am I.

942
00:43:46,458 --> 00:43:48,827
Let me know if you find
an extra one.

943
00:43:48,860 --> 00:43:50,928
I think you know
what I meant.

944
00:43:50,962 --> 00:43:53,865
Be sure and shut the door.
There's a draft.

945
00:43:53,898 --> 00:43:55,333
Yeah, all right.

946
00:43:55,367 --> 00:43:57,602
'Cause I'm nude, you know.

947
00:43:57,635 --> 00:43:59,103
You know,
I'd drop into an apartment

948
00:43:59,137 --> 00:44:00,738
and it would be bella abzug.

949
00:44:00,772 --> 00:44:03,242
- Whoa.
- Ugh.

950
00:44:03,275 --> 00:44:05,377
You can come out now.
He's gone.

951
00:44:05,410 --> 00:44:07,045
How clever, to think
of hiding in the closet.

952
00:44:07,078 --> 00:44:08,380
Well, how about that, hmm?

953
00:44:08,413 --> 00:44:10,782
- You were wonderful.
- I tried on your blue outfit.

954
00:44:10,815 --> 00:44:13,052
