- Yes?

955
00:44:13,085 --> 00:44:14,285
Is a king-sized cigarette.

956
00:44:14,318 --> 00:44:15,320
Sure. Why not?

957
00:44:15,353 --> 00:44:16,422
- Wow.
- Hmm.

958
00:44:16,455 --> 00:44:17,688
I don't know who you are,
honey,

959
00:44:17,722 --> 00:44:19,257
but bart fargo
owes you a favor.

960
00:44:19,290 --> 00:44:20,425
