boyfriend, bart.

969
00:44:36,342 --> 00:44:38,243
What's the name?

970
00:44:38,277 --> 00:44:39,812
Mark anthony.

971
00:44:39,845 --> 00:44:41,280
No, I meant your name.

972
00:44:41,313 --> 00:44:42,848
Brutus.

973
00:44:42,882 --> 00:44:43,882
Lucille.

974
00:44:43,915 --> 00:44:45,950
[Imitating little richard]
Lucille!

975
00:44:45,983 --> 00:44:50,422
Well, lucille, mark anthony's
a very lucky fellow.

976
00:44:50,455 --> 00:44:52,157
It's been a pleasure.

977
00:44:52,190 --> 00:44:53,625
I sure hate having
to send you away,

978
00:44:53,658 --> 00:44:56,228
but I've got
to finish the picture.

979
00:44:56,262 --> 00:44:58,863
Thanks again. Lucille.

980
00:44:58,897 --> 00:45:02,333
Hey, what's with the secret
agent who keeps striking out?

981
00:45:02,367 --> 00:45:05,403
They're just waiting
outside the door.

982
00:45:09,107 --> 00:45:12,077
Well, you can tell
by the way I use my walk,

983
00:45:12,110 --> 00:45:15,413
I'm a woman's man,
no time to talk.

984
00:45:17,748 --> 00:45:18,750
[Knocks]

985
00:45:18,783 --> 00:45:19,785
Come in.

986
00:45:19,818 --> 00:45:23,622
"Let's go to my hotel."

987
00:45:23,655 --> 00:45:27,793
Your breakfast, senor.

988
00:45:27,827 --> 00:45:28,860
Put it on the table.

989
00:45:28,893 --> 00:45:30,962
Then put you on the me.

990
00:45:30,995 --> 00:45:34,600
Oh, we ordered one of those
crappy european breakfasts.

991
00:45:38,303 --> 00:45:42,273
Freshly baked.
[Chuckles]

992
00:45:42,307 --> 00:45:47,045
Senor, we've cleaned
and pressed your gun.

993
00:45:47,078 --> 00:45:50,448
We're gonna put an end
to this towel stealing

994
00:45:50,482 --> 00:45:53,818
