995
00:45:53,852 --> 00:45:58,123
David cassidy is abe lincoln
behind confederate lines.

996
00:46:00,392 --> 00:46:03,228
Oh!

997
00:46:03,262 --> 00:46:07,565
This happened when I was
mannix's bellboy too. Oh.

998
00:46:07,598 --> 00:46:10,868
Lincoln actually fought
golden gloves.

999
00:46:10,902 --> 00:46:11,903
Ooh.

1000
00:46:11,937 --> 00:46:13,072
