1001
00:46:13,105 --> 00:46:16,608
Oh, I've got
a rail-splitting headache.

1002
00:46:16,642 --> 00:46:20,578
You're no raymond massey
to us, mr.

1003
00:46:20,612 --> 00:46:22,480
No, it's real!

1004
00:46:22,513 --> 00:46:26,418
Oh, it's...

1005
00:46:26,452 --> 00:46:27,452
You know, scarface,

1006
00:46:27,485 --> 00:46:28,953
that was a very silly getup.

1007
00:46:28,987 --> 00:46:30,988
It didn't suit you.

1008
00:46:31,022 --> 00:46:35,293
And your imitation of a waiter
was very funny.

1009
00:46:35,327 --> 00:46:38,797
"Your breakfast, senor."

1010
00:46:38,830 --> 00:46:42,167
You should have changed
your voice too.

1011
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:43,802
- Ole.
- Aah!

1012
00:46:43,835 --> 00:46:45,537
And the way you
dove out the window

1013
00:46:45,570 --> 00:46:47,838
