1014
00:46:47,872 --> 00:46:49,775
Ooh. Sorry, ma'am.

1015
00:46:49,808 --> 00:46:51,243
That's too bad.

1016
00:46:51,277 --> 00:46:52,310
Oh, come on!

1017
00:46:52,343 --> 00:46:53,745
What about
"he really fell for me"?

1018
00:46:53,778 --> 00:46:55,013
"His hopes are crushed"?

1019
00:46:55,047 --> 00:46:57,015
Ah.

1020
00:46:57,048 --> 00:46:58,883
[Sirens wailing]

1021
00:47:04,322 --> 00:47:06,258
♪ Barcelona wants me ♪

1022
00:47:06,292 --> 00:47:10,662
